    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wexford County Council, in partnership with Liam Neville Developments, is delighted to announce the launch of a new phase of 10 homes available under the Affordable Purchase Scheme at Cúl Caisleán, Taghmon, offering eligible purchasers the opportunity to buy a high-quality, energy-efficient new home at a reduced purchase price.\r\n\r\nLocated in the heart of the thriving village of Taghmon, Cúl Caisleán is an attractive new residential development designed to provide modern, comfortable living in a well-connected community. These thoughtfully designed homes combine contemporary architecture, quality finishes and excellent energy performance, making them ideal for first-time buyers and eligible home purchasers.\r\n\r\nTaghmon offers an excellent range of local amenities including primary and secondary schools, supermarkets, cafés, pharmacy, medical centre, sporting facilities and community services, while Wexford Town is approximately 15 minutes away, providing easy access to employment, shopping, education and leisure opportunities. The N25 and M11 road networks are also within easy reach, making commuting straightforward.\r\n\r\nAffordable Purchase Scheme - \r\n\r\nEligible purchasers can buy a new home at a reduced price, with Wexford County Council providing an Affordable Dwelling Contribution to bridge the gap between the market value of the home and the purchaser's maximum mortgage and deposit capacity. In return, the Council retains a percentage equity share in the property.\r\n\r\nApplication Process - \r\n\r\nApplications for these homes must be submitted through Wexford County Council Affordable Housing Online Application Portal.\r\nApplication Portal Opens: 12.00pm Wednesday, 5th August 2026\r\n\r\nProspective applicants are strongly encouraged to review the eligibility requirements and supporting documentation in advance of the application period links -  \r\nhttps://www.wexfordcoco.ie/housing/affordable-housing/local-authority-affordable-purchase-scheme \r\n\r\nApplicant Information Events - Register Now\r\n\r\nTo help prospective applicants understand the scheme and navigate the application process, Wexford County Council are hosting in-person/online events including,\r\n\r\n•          Information Launch Event – 22nd July 2026, 7.00pm, Taghmon Action Group Centre, Taghmon, Co. Wexford.\r\n\r\n•          Application Webinar – Online Event, 29th July, 7.00pm\r\n\r\nTo register to attend any of these events please email rsvp@wexfordcoco.ie     \r\n\r\nRegister Your Interest - \r\n\r\nTo receive updates and information on this and future affordable housing developments, register your interest through Wexford County Council's Affordable Housing Expression of Interest Portal.\r\n\r\nEnquiries -\r\n\r\nEmail: affordablehousing@wexfordcoco.ie\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today and take the first step towards owning your new home at Cúl Caisleán, Taghmon."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "- Information Launch Event – 22nd July 2026, 7.00pm\r\n\r\n- Spacious contemporary homes finished to a high specification\r\n\r\n- A-rated, energy-efficient design for lower running costs\r\n\r\n- Air-to-water heat pump heating system\r\n\r\n- Modern fitted kitchens and quality sanitary ware\r\n\r\n- Private gardens and off-street parking\r\n\r\n- Excellent location within walking distance of village amenities\r\n\r\n- Easy access to Wexford Town, Rosslare Europort and the M11\r\n\r\n- Applicants can avail of Help To Buy"
      },
